  "subdivision_of_building": "Rear Ground floor -  Flat 1  -  Rear First floor including side",
  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "cil_liability": true,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;Default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposal development, by reason of the failure to provide\r\na 3-bedroom, 4 person or larger family-size unit as part of the scheme would have a\r\ndetrimental impact on the boroughs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;existing and\r\nfuture housing needs and ability to deliver additional family sized dwellings households\r\nto replace loss of existing stock. As such, the failure to provide an complementary\r\nthree (3) bed residential unit is contrary to Policy H10(8) (Housing size mix)\r\nof the London Plan (2021) and policy H02 (conversion and redevelopment of\r\ndwellings) of the Harrow emerging Local plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposal by reason of the low PTAL (2) level and access concerns from the adopted highways are considered to result in a development with poor sustainable transport options to the detriment of future occupiers and parking capacity. As such, the development is contrary to policy DM1 of the development Management policies (2013) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;policy H02 (conversion and redevelopment of dwellings) of the Harrow emerging Local plan (2021-2041).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
